# Alper Scheel

## About Me | Über mich

I work at the intersection of artificial intelligence, quantum computing, and infrastructure.  
With a multidisciplinary background in politics, law, defense, and business, I focus on scalable system development that bridges classical and quantum approaches.  
I operate dedicated AI hardware and implement privacy-aware, production-ready models using frameworks such as Qiskit, Cirq, and Q#.

My work is driven by long-term value, ethical responsibility, and a commitment to technological independence.  
I believe that meaningful innovation must serve more than efficiency—it must have purpose, durability, and social relevance.

